. Startup-performance optimization is deferred; this release fixes availability, not startup speed. Do not delete historical roots or reset migration records to bypass startup.\n\nSelf-hosted installations should stop all writers and take a consistent backup before upgrading; deploy matching web/server versions together. Never restore old originals over newer writes.\n","isDraft":false,"isPrerelease":false,"publishedAt":"2026-09-27T05:11:15Z","tagName":"v1.4.88","targetCommitish":"98d83c12ff57deb9eeed2847c43e186a4b71542a","url":"https://github.com/AutoByteus/autobyteus-workspace/releases/tag/v1.4.88"}
